# This repository holds SOURCE between releases. Compiled scripts and plugins are
# committed ONLY by the release step, which copies them from the author's build and
# checks them by hash - with `git add -f`, because they are ignored here on purpose.
# Ignoring them makes the mistake safe: a stray build output is never committed by
# accident, and a release that forgets a file shows up as a missing file.
*.pex
*.esp
*.esl
*.esm
*.bsa

# Editor and tool leftovers
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*
*.pex.tmp
.vs/
*.user
